        <body>
            <div xml:id="d350">

                <pb facs="0361" n="296" xml:id="pg296"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.84/101: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister Resident
                        in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-06-15T17:00:00-04:00">June 15, 1936—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>278. Your 418, June 12, 3 p.m. Department approves of your practice in addressing
                    Graziani only as Commander in Chief and desires you to follow that form.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
